  "qualifications": [
    "Ruby 1.8.3 has no RUBY_PATCHLEVEL constant; this is not p0. Bundler denotes the attested 0.3.1 archive, whose Bundler::VERSION reports 0.5.0. RubyGems reports Gem::RubyGemsVersion 1.0.1.",
    "The environment-v03 frontend validates and replays a cached, precompiled SDK input. No native Gemfile.lock is created. Its versioned validator is not a claim of equivalence to original gem-exec behavior.",
    "Publication uses an independently attested Ruby 1.8.4 / RubyGems 1.3.5 / Gemcutter 0.3.0 SDK, with publisher-only json_pure 1.8.6; it does not use the Ruby 1.8.3 consumer as publisher. Gemcutter user-agent reports 0.2.0.",
    "An ordinary RubyGems 1.0.1 consumer installs from the fixture registry and executes the projected JSON 1.1.3 native payload. The driver asserts uploaded/payload byte joins; remote binaries and archives were not independently downloaded here.",
    "Declared Nix inputs and relocation replay execute with the original project root unavailable. This does not establish cold source-extension compilation, general ABI compatibility, sandboxed pure builds, or a supported version range.",
    "The successful evidence comes from attempt 2 after an external artifact-upload failure in attempt 1; attempt 1 native execution itself succeeded."
